#: ../../user/plugin-clipboard-manager.md:1
msgid "`@rescript-tauri/plugin-clipboard-manager`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/plugin-clipboard-manager.md:3
msgid ""
"ReScript bindings for the [Tauri 2.x clipboard "
"plugin](https://v2.tauri.app/plugin/clipboard/) — read and write text, "
"HTML, and images."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/plugin-clipboard-manager.md:8
msgid ""
"The Phase 2 implementation is feature-complete in `main`. The first npm "
"publish (`plugin-clipboard-manager-v0.1.0`) is scheduled alongside the "
"other Phase 2 packages. Until then, consume `@rescript-tauri/plugin-"
"clipboard-manager` via the source repository or a workspace link."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/plugin-clipboard-manager.md:16
msgid ""
"The image APIs (`writeImage` / `readImage`) reuse `@rescript-"
"tauri/core`'s [`Image`](https://github.com/Nagatatz/rescript-"
"tauri/blob/main/packages/core/src/Image.resi) module directly — no "
"separate image type ships with this package. Construct an `Image.t` with "
"`Core.Image.fromPath` or `Core.Image.fromBytes`, write it via "
"`writeImage`, and inspect clipboard image bytes with `Core.Image.rgba`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/plugin-clipboard-manager.md:25
msgid "Install"
msgstr "インストール"

#: ../../user/plugin-clipboard-manager.md:31
msgid ""
"`@rescript-tauri/plugin-clipboard-manager` declares both `@rescript-"
"tauri/core` and `@tauri-apps/plugin-clipboard-manager` as "
"`peerDependencies`, so you control each upstream version."
msgstr ""

