#: ../../user/plugin-clipboard-manager.md:82
msgid ""
"`clipboard-manager:default` covers every read and write API exposed by "
"this binding. To allow only a subset, swap it for the narrower aliases "
"shipped by the plugin "
"([reference](https://v2.tauri.app/plugin/clipboard/#permissions)) — for "
"example `clipboard-manager:allow-write-text` plus `clipboard-manager"
":allow-read-text` for a paste-only utility."
